{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Triple Shot Espresso is a ",["l","烹饪","cooked"]," drink. It is prepared using either the kitchen inside an upgraded ",["l","农舍","farmhouse"]," or a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],". Before it can be cooked, the recipe must be purchased from ",["l","格斯","Gus"]," while he's working the bar at the saloon for 5,000g."]],["p",["Triple Shot Espresso can also be purchased at the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," in exchange for a ",["l","钻石","Diamond"],", sometimes at the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Stardew Valley Fair"]," for 400 Prize Tickets, at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"]," for 2,500g, or at the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 1,350–2,250g. 1-2 Triple Shot Espresso may occasionally be found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图#Beach","Beach Farm"]," if the player upgraded the ",["l","农舍","Farmhouse"]," at least once. Three Triple Shot Espresso is the reward for donating 70 items to the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"],". Wearing a ",["l","热咖啡戒指","Hot Java Ring"]," gives a 7.5% chance for monsters to drop Triple Shot Espresso when killed. Two Triple Shot Espresso is one of the prizes for the ",["l","鳟鱼大赛","Trout Derby"]," festival. Three Triple Shot Espresso is a guaranteed gold tier reward on the 13th for the ",["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]," festival. Three Triple Shot Espresso may be received from opening a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"]," or ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],". Five Triple Shot Espresso can be obtained as a prize from the ",["l","镇长的庄园#Prize Machine","Prize Machine"],". It is a reward for submitting an ",["l","沙漠节#Skull Cavern","Egg Rating"]," of 10-54 to ",["l","吉尔","Gil"]," during the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],"."]],["p",["When consumed, it grants the player +1 ",["l","速度#Player Speed","Speed"]," for 4m 12s. The speed of the player's ",["l","动物#Horse","horse"]," is also increased.\nAs a drink, its ",["l","效果","buff"]," stacks with any food buffs (including Speed), but replaces any other drink buffs (i.e., from ",["l","咖啡","Coffee"],", ",["l","姜汁汽水","Ginger Ale"]," or ",["l","绿茶","Green Tea"],")."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Triple Shot Espresso is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["p",["Triple Shot Espresso is not used in any recipes."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Triple Shot Espresso can be used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["f","Shirt269.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Pour-Over Shirt"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as an orange dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Triple Shot Espresso is not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]],["Secret",2,[["p",["After hatching the first ",["l","恐龙蛋","Dinosaur Egg"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"]," will gift the player a Triple Shot Espresso."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4.4","1.4.4"],": ",["l","贾斯","Jas"]," & ",["l","文森特","Vincent"]," now hate it as a gift."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Can now be prepared using a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],". Can now be found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图#Beach","Beach Farm"],". Can now be obtained from the ",["l","热咖啡戒指","Hot Java Ring"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5.4","1.5.4"],": Added to the rotating stock at the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Stardew Valley Fair"],", replacing ",["l","茶苗","Tea Sapling"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Now one of the prizes from ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es, ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],"es, the ",["l","鳟鱼大赛","Trout Derby"]," festival, the ",["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]," festival, ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],", and the ",["l","镇长的庄园#Prize Machine","Prize Machine"],". Now sometimes sold at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],"."]]]]]]]}